# This repository tracks source only. Datasets, model weights, generated text
# labels and run outputs stay on disk but out of git: they are large, several
# are third-party-licensed and not ours to redistribute, and GitHub rejects any
# single file over 100 MB. See docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md for where they belong
# instead, and README.md "Datasets" for how to obtain or regenerate each one.

# --- Datasets and ground truth -------------------------------------------
# Ego-Exo4D requires accepting its own licence; data/ holds only
# local symlinks and the GT exports, neither of which we redistribute.
data/*
!data/README.md

# --- Model weights --------------------------------------------------------
# 787 MB each, plus Meta's unmodified SAM 2.1 release, which is better fetched
# from its own source than mirrored here.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
checkpoint/
training/checkpoints_EgoExo/

# --- Generated text labels ------------------------------------------------
# 2.9 GB and 638,884 files of DAM-3B captions, regenerable with
# tools/precompute_dam_frame_captions.py.
text_labels/

# --- Run outputs and intermediates ---------------------------------------
outputs/
output/
sam2_logs/
work_dirs/
probe_out/
proto_out/
*.log

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.lock

# --- OS / editor ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store

# --- Scratch -------------------------------------------------------------
# Debug inputs and temporary ablation configs; `_ablation_pooling.yaml` says so
# in its own header ("Not part of the release").
tools/single_take.txt
sam2/configs/**/_*.yaml
